---
kind: scene
id: camp.wrenLeaves
title: Wren goes home
on: camp
priority: 50
when: "holds(inParty(wren)) && (quest.toll.state == 'complete' || run.approval.wren <= -3)"
---

## The Edge of the Firelight

::auto{character="wren" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@narrator: Wren has her pack on. She has not said goodbye to anyone, which is how you know she means to.
<match on="quest.toll.state">
  <when is="complete">
    @wren{emotion="angry"}: Tam's friends are in a Duskbound cage tonight because you wanted a bridge more than you wanted to be a person.
    @wren: I'm going home. Somebody at the ford has to be there when Maelis's people come knocking. It won't be you.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @wren: I keep waiting for you to become someone I'd follow. The river's patient. I'm not.
  </otherwise>
</match>
@wren: Don't follow me. The river knows your face now.
::auto{character="wren" action="fadeOut"}
::assert{departed(wren)}
@narrator: Wren has left the party.
